| Placeholder | kind | declared in | role |
|---|---|---|---|
| `<STORE:MaterialProxy>` | proxy | OpticalConstructor.Domain | mutating materials write-seam |
| `<STORE:SampleProxy>` | proxy | OpticalConstructor.Domain | mutating samples write-seam |
| `<UICOMP:MaterialsControls>` | component | OpticalConstructor.Controls | Materials bay control (domain-free) |
